[[Eliezer]] has lots of terms to describe how intelligent/powerful/whatever an agent is.

* Relevant
* Pivotal (is this only for actions, or also for agents, as in "agent who can perform a pivotal action"?)
* sufficiently optimized
* highly optimized
* cognitively powerful
* powerful (is this a shorthand for cognitively powerful?)
* relevant powerful [https://arbital.com/p/powerful_agent_highly_optimized/] = "cognitively powerful enough to be relevant to existential outcomes"
* sufficiently advanced
* advanced

